### VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client ile çalıştırılabilir örnek istekler
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### İşveren girişi
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "employer" }

### Aday listesi (%100 eşleşme, önerilen sıra)
GET {{base}}/candidates?tab=perfect&sort=recommended
Authorization: Bearer dev-employer

### Görüşme talebi gönder
POST {{base}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer dev-employer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "workerIds": ["w_merve", "w_derya"] }

### Boş seçim → 400
POST {{base}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer dev-employer
Content-Type: application/json

{ "workerIds": [] }

### İş arayan: bekleyen talepler
GET {{base}}/offers?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer dev-worker

### Kabul et
POST {{base}}/offers/o_garson/accept
Authorization: Bearer dev-worker

### Reddet
POST {{base}}/offers/o_barista/reject
Authorization: Bearer dev-worker

### Cevaplananlar
GET {{base}}/offers?status=answered
Authorization: Bearer dev-worker

### Süresi dolanlar
GET {{base}}/offers?status=expired
Authorization: Bearer dev-worker
